# The build context of the helper image (apps/helper/Dockerfile, built from the repository root): only the files its
# COPY lines read. Everything else, .git, node_modules, every other package and every test, stays out.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!apps/helper/package.json
!apps/helper/src
!packages/kit/package.json
!packages/kit/src
**/node_modules
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.mjs
**/fixtures
**/.env*
**/*.pem
